22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in the released 4.8 Dev7 build, and Dev6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev7 - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Tue, 08 Sep 2026 10:22:31 +0000 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor (3440x1440 @ 159.92 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT (RADV NAVI21) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K (20 threads) - 62.56 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nTexture Streaming will completely cease to function with certain textures due to not forcing a refresh.\nOnly way to \"fix\" it is to either keep Max LOD at a reasonable count like 3, or to re-assign the texture in the shader to force a refresh.\n\nThis is a major problem for the project me and others are working on, as it introduces constant bugs and makes testing extremely difficult.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project\n2. Copy over the same leaves textures, tree and texture streaming settings\n3. Save the texture streaming settings to the project\n4. Add to scene, save and reload project\n5. Notice how the leaves are gone\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nLaunch the project in 4.8 Dev7 and notice how the leaves are gone.\n[broken-tex-streaming.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33064169/broken-tex-streaming.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124180/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124180/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}